05/file-1l253l7sm.png?format=png 1500w, https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/2000/image/1l253l7sl/7092c06f-d3b1-4324-80f2-e8decda1c6cb/015d1560-bf4c-11ec-b997-87cc5d16a405/file-1l253l7sm.png?format=png 2000w, https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/2500/image/1l253l7sl/7092c06f-d3b1-4324-80f2-e8decda1c6cb/015d1560-bf4c-11ec-b997-87cc5d16a405/file-1l253l7sm.png?format=png 2500w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 767px) 100vw, 720px\" decoding=\"async\"></p>\n<p>Let M and l be the mass and length of the rod respectively and m be the mass of the insect. Let the insect be at a distance x from O at any instant of time t.</p>\n<p><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.186ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"1.509ex\" height=\"1.251ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -471 667 553\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mo\"><use data-c=\"2234\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2234\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> x = vt ....... (i)</p>\n<p>Angular momentum of the system about O,</p>\n<p><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -1.469ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"19.364ex\" height=\"4.07ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -1149.5 8558.8 1799\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D43F\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D43F\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(958.8,0)\"><use data-c=\"3D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-3D\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mrow\" transform=\"translate(2014.6,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(0 -0.5)\"><use data-c=\"5B\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-LO-